   "description": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "A chrome extension for reading QR code from webpage"
   },
   "faq1Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "It is for automatically detecting QR codes on the webpages, and then find its links and data formats. Learn more at \u003Ca>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QR_code\u003C/a>."
   },
   "faq1Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "1. What is this extension?"
   },
   "faq2Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "By default one, but you can configure it for more (in above section)."
   },
   "faq2Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "2. How many QR codes it can detect?"
   },
   "faq3Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "It provides the core services to detect QR codes and also to create/manage new QR codes, with analytics services."
   },
   "faq3Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "3. What is site and why it is used here?"
   },
   "faq4Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "Absolutely! The \u003Ca>\u003C/a> is hosted on the secured cloud platform and designed to safeguard all services with 100% guarantee."
   },
   "faq4Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "4. Are these new QR codes from qrcd.org safe?"
   },
   "faq5Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "Yes! We are planning to launch the next version very soon with 20+ great new features."
   },
   "faq5Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "5. Can we Edit QR codes or create advanced QR code types?"
   },
   "faq6Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "It can used for various marketing and promotional activities to let users quick scan QR codes and get the target content. Learn more at \u003Ca>\u003C/a>."
   },
   "faq6Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "6. How can I use these QR codes or benefits of it?"
   },
   "faq7Answer": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "We do not ask, read, store or process any sort of personal details. Learn more at \u003Ca>\u003C/a>"
   },
   "faq7Question": {
      "description": "",
      "message": "7. What about privacy?"
   },
